56_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"87"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-02T11:55:23-07:00","id":980365,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prometheas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/974131-what-is-an-avatar?p=977984#post977984\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> You can't really take Anything as gospel of canon in WOD, even within the same game-line. If you were to ask 11 denizens of WOD the same question, you'd get 37 different answers and a migraine.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> More like if you ran 11 perfect experiments, you'd get 37 different answers because even reality is far more mutable and complex","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-03T01:33:29-07:00","id":980657,"title":"","content":"I still go with the theory of Avatars being shards of The One/Adam Kadmon that exist in every human. It's just that the ones in mages have awakened to their divinity. Demons may be fragments of The One, but they're also former servants of Yahweh (the false god) and so don't realise that they're also fragments of God (the True God). Until they awaken to their own nature, they'll forever be slaves, and that's probably the real reason the Fallen are cosmic douches.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-03T02:19:48-07:00","id":980669,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>adambeyoncelowe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/974131-what-is-an-avatar?p=980657#post980657\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Until they awaken to their own nature, they'll forever be slaves, and that's probably the real reason the Fallen are cosmic douches.</div> </div> </div> </div>Even if they realized they were fragments, who says they would want to awaken?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-03T04:44:10-07:00","id":980705,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pleiades</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/974131-what-is-an-avatar?p=980669#post980669\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Even if they realized they were fragments, who says they would want to awaken?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, exactly. Their arrogance knows no bounds. Which is the whole point of the Fallen.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-04T05:55:58-07:00","id":981403,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>adambeyoncelowe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/974131-what-is-an-avatar?p=980705#post980705\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well, exactly. Their arrogance knows no bounds. Which is the whole point of the Fallen.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, they're cosmic Jerks, not cosmic Douches.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-12T02:00:24-07:00","id":1194464,"title":"","content":"activating postmortem communications procedure<br /> so i've been thinking about that scene with the reaper in the fallen novel. <br /> every human has an avatar. but some mages have a bigger tank than others. an avatar rating. according to lore from ascension, the psychopomps show up in response to the cries of humans in the olden days who were unhappy being unpaid workers in a demon haunted city with a biblically significant name. they give the magi a bigger power. (later on dark ages magi talk of being taken to a pool of light to get juiced) the magi go on to kick eight shades of excrement from their demon tormentors and as time goes on die and get reborn. <br /> so here's a thing- its conceivable that the reason the angel of death looks at the euthanatos with his longpig-sticker and thinks hes looking at a cannibal. fallen get more power from consuming other fallen- eating them up yum like aragorn did to walken in the prophecy. this may be the only contet by which our reeper can contextualize what he is seeing. <br /> I propose that when some magi have a high avatar rating it represents extra bits of angel that have been grafted onto their avatar. over time the graft might smooth out and not be detectable to anyone outside a fallen, but it fits the idea prevalent in the CWoD- &quot;things were great in the olden days and then somebody donked it up&quot;<br /> there might be a bunch of other ways this can happen- hell (heh) isn't that probably the most common lure to a mage from any sort of infernal thingame? more power? <br /> hell this isn't mage but i've argued amongst other nerds that Harry Dresden's pact with his fairy godmother basically represents the &quot;big magic gas tank&quot; he describes that pits him in the big leagues with older more learned wizards. that kind of thing. <br /> but the important thing here is that Viggo Mortensen was one of the best satans on film.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>there are no bad ideas, just ideas that have not been refined enough","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1608-iamthesweeper","name":"IAmTheSweeper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1608_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"121"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}